<statement>
<p>
Write the system of equations as an augmented matrix</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{\left\lbrace\begin{array}{ccccccc} {6}{x}\amp-\amp{3}{y}\amp-\amp{z}\amp=\amp{3}\\{6}{x}\amp-\amp{3}{y}\amp-\amp{6}{z}\amp=\amp{3}\\{6}{x}\amp+\amp{6}{y}\amp-\amp{4}{z}\amp=\amp{1}\end{array}\right.}</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="20"/>   </p>


</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li><m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{cccc} {6}\amp-{3}\amp-{1}\amp{3}\\{6}\amp-{3}\amp-{6}\amp{3}\\{6}\amp{6}\amp-{4}\amp{1}\end{array}\right]}</m></li></ul></p>
</answer>

